My roommate was playing in explore mode when he found a crash-the-
machine bug.  I don't think he was in wizard mode.  He used his wand
of wishing to create a blessed ring of polymorph control and a
blessed ring of polymorph and used them to change into a black
dragon.  Later, he got caught by a booby trapped door.  It went boom,
his stats returned to normal (i.e., unpolymorphed him), and then the
machine gave a --more-- message that wouldn't die.  Ctrl-Alt-Del was
not sufficient to restart; I had to use the reset switch.  I suspect
this was a bug, not a feature |-).

Just for the sake of information, what is the difference between a
blessed and an uncursed ring of xxx?


